Dane Backbier - dbackbie - dbackbie@u.rochester.edu - Lab 6 - Binary Search Trees

Lab 6 is aimed at implementing a binary search tree ADT class in Java. To test
UR_BST.java simply compile and run the code(keeping assertions enabled). This
is the expected output (where all tests are passed):
put and get methods passed.

put method error handling passed.

isEmpty, size, and contains methods passed.

deleteMin and deleteMax methods passed.

delete method passed.

height method passed.

levelOrder method passed.

All tests passed!

The other files in this file are the various class files created when compiling
UR_BST.java, this README and the instructions pdf. All the tests are ran from
the main method of UR_BST.java so no extra testing file is needed.